sequenceDiagram
    %% SD3 - Share files and hand in homework
    %% Stories: 5, 8, 10, 11, 13, 18, 32, 44
    %% Description: A teacher uploads files for classes and students are notified. Students open the files and modules of their class and hand in homework, and the teacher is notified.
    actor TP as Teacher (person)
    actor SP as Student (person)
    participant TE as Teacher
    participant CL as Class
    participant DM as DigitalLearningModule
    participant MA as Material
    participant ST as Student
    participant SU as Submission
    participant ASG as Assignment

    %% covers 44
    TP->>TE: upload files for classes
    TE->>CL: classes
    CL->>DM: class modules
    DM->>MA: files
    %% covers 32
    CL->>TE: notify of completed upload
    %% covers 13
    CL->>ST: notify of new files
    %% covers 5, 10
    SP->>ST: open files and modules of the class
    %% covers 8
    SP->>ST: hand in homework
    ST->>SU: submission
    SU->>ASG: assignment
    ASG->>CL: class of the assignment
    %% covers 18
    CL->>TE: notify of new submission
    %% covers 11
    CL->>ST: remind of assignment due soon
